          "title": "Hold-and-Respin Feature",
          "text": "Landing 6 scatter <safe> symbols awards 3 initial free hold-and-respins.\n\nDuring the Hold-and-Respin feature, <safe> that trigger the spin become sticky for the remainder of the respins.\n\nOnly <blank> <boxer> and/or <safe> symbols can land during Hold-and-Respin. \n\nThe respin counter resets to 3 each time a <boxer> or <safe> lands. All new <safe> become sticky for the remainder of the free respins. \n\nA <boxer> landing next to a <safe> collects its value and may add a multiplier for future <safe> landing in the same spot.\n\nIf a <safe> tumbles out of a position with a multiplier, that multiplier is no longer applied.\n\nEach punch also award an additional punch as the reels tumble to place a new <safe> in front of <boxer>.\n\nThe Hold-and-Respin feature ends when no free respins remain. The Hold and Re-Spin feature cannot be triggered during the Eddie Glassjaw feature.",
